{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combo Vectors is a mouse-only game where you attack enemies by creating the correct patterns that appear next to them. The radar system also helps in your defense, and after each round you can upgrade it to gain new abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840860/extras/c9098ea17a21b40fecf063452baca02c.avif?t=1774431338\" width=1135 height=81 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the mouse to evade enemy attacks, as well as to create the Braille dot patterns that help you fight back. Collecting the resource points that the defeated enemies leave behind will also increase your combo meter and will increase the speed of the radar lance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840860/extras/589795bcf1d8961ca4541ce1615d6fc1.avif?t=1774431338\" width=1440 height=810 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840860/extras/aadccf57b61b6cb4a60d776eb8cfacc0.avif?t=1774431338\" width=1141 height=81 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Choose between three radar systems, each with their own unique ability and movement pattern. Each time the radar detects an enemy, it can either trigger one of the upgrades you have selected, or it can activate its unique ability. From deflecting enemy attacks to creating areas that slow enemies down, the radar system is another weapon that will help you make it to the next round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840860/extras/58735a5e360e1030096551039bcb3c6c.avif?t=1774431338\" width=1135 height=81 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your playstyle with unique upgrades, which you can select after each round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Upgrades that can change each run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Lots of different enemies, with different behaviors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a03 unique radar systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Customization options</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made with\u00a0L\u00d6VE. Font for cover image is\u00a0m5x7 by Daniel Linssen. Trailer song is Final Level by\u00a0HoliznaCC0.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3840860?t=1774431338","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3840860?t=1774431338","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840860/890d8ad2df462e0a207f014be8ec8abf120632c0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774431338","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840860/890d8ad2df462e0a207f014be8ec8abf120632c0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774431338","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4421920,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combo Vectors is a mouse-only game where you attack enemies by creating the correct patterns that appear next to them. The radar system also helps in your defense, and after each round you can upgrade it to gain new abilities.</p><p class